[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4022.71, "timestamp": "01:07:02", "text": "对……感到恐惧是很自然的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4025.99, "timestamp": "01:07:05", "text": "未知。然而，有时……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4028.63, "timestamp": "01:07:08", "text": "未知之处蕴藏着希望。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4030.71, "timestamp": "01:07:10", "text": "就像我永远无法知道还有什么其他事情一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4036.789, "timestamp": "01:07:16", "text": "等等，这个……这个有趣的事情并不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4039.99, "timestamp": "01:07:19", "text": "婴儿。我真的得到了一样东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4041.91, "timestamp": "01:07:21", "text": "来自应用程序。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4045.75, "timestamp": "01:07:25", "text": "这是哪个版本？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4055.45, "timestamp": "01:07:35", "text": "乔治亚州就没有好东西吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4075.99, "timestamp": "01:07:55", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4077.77, "timestamp": "01:07:57", "text": "这样更好。是的。"}]